# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in the working tree, whatever
# platform or tool wrote it. Git decides which files are text.
#
# Without this, a file written by a tool that translates newlines is committed
# with the other convention and then diffs whole on its next edit, which buries
# the actual change and makes the history of that file unreadable.
* text=auto eol=lf
